<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>List of Abbreviations</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section provides a comprehensive list of abbreviations and acronyms used throughout this paper. The abbreviations are organized by category for easy reference, with their corresponding full forms to assist readers in understanding the technical terminology.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Mathematical Foundations and Concepts</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Abbreviation</span></th>
<th id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Full Form</span></th></tr>
</thead>
