<td id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Partially Observable Markov Decision Process <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib43" title="" class="ltx_ref">Åström, 1965</a>]</cite></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">RBF</td>
<td id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Radial Basis Function <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Garreau et al., 2017</a>]</cite></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">SWD</td>
<td id="A1.SSx1.p1.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Sliced Wasserstein Distance <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rabin et al., 2011</a>]</cite></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
