<td id="A1.SSx2.p1.1.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Stein Variational Gradient Descent <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu, 2017</a>]</cite></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SSx2.p1.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
